
# Student Performance Analysis 📊

## Project Overview
This project analyzes student academic performance using Python.
It explores marks, attendance, and study hours to identify patterns
and generate useful insights.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn

## Features
- Dataset inspection and analysis
- Missing value and duplicate checking
- Total and average marks calculation
- Automatic grade assignment
- Pass/Fail classification
- Student ranking
- Data visualization
- CSV report generation

## Visualizations
1. Top 5 Students by Average Marks
2. Distribution of Student Average Marks
3. Student Performance Correlation Heatmap

## Project Files
- students.csv
- student_performance_analysis.py
- student_performance_report.csv
- top_5_students.png
- marks_distribution.png
- correlation_heatmap.png

## How to Run

Install dependencies:

pip install pandas numpy matplotlib seaborn

Run:

python student_performance_analysis.py

## Learning Outcomes
Practiced data analysis, data manipulation,
statistical summaries, and visualization using Python.

